  "implemented": [
    "Ordinary horizontal normal line height from selected-face ascent, descent and line gap; authored and explicit default leading preserved.",
    "Approved library-selected default font frozen before authoritative pagination and print fitting, with shared resources, diagnostics, cancellation and cumulative budget.",
    "Declared literal page-margin Unicode included through the existing effective cascade and bounded rule visits.",
    "Table cell fragmentation uses actual line endings; Browser tables have no invented outer margin.",
    "Shared Core fallback runs preserve same-family selected faces across glyphs and mapped/synthesized EM-space graphemes.",
    "HTML, Email and EPUB premium raster baselines inspected and updated; Word, PowerPoint and OneNote pixels unchanged.",
    "Shared PDF library-font preset keeps HTML document-selected host fonts disabled by default under the newer PDF owner; explicit caller overrides survive typed cloning."
  ],
